id="bib27"><citation citation-type="journal">Lee, G.M., A. Ishihara, and K.A. Jacobson. <year>1991</year>. Direct observation of brownian motion of lipids in a membrane. <source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source> <volume>88</volume>:<fpage>6274</fpage>&#x02013;6278.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1712486</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib28"><citation citation-type="journal">Lidke, D.S., K.A. Lidke, B. Rieger, T.M. Jovin, and D.J. Arndt-Jovin. <year>2005</year>. Reaching out for signals: filopodia sense EGF and respond by directed retrograde transport of activated receptors. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>170</volume>:<fpage>619</fpage>&#x02013;626.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16103229</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib29"><citation citation-type="journal">Marsh, M., and A. Helenius. <year>2006</year>. Virus entry: open sesame. <source>Cell.</source> <volume>124</volume>:<fpage>729</fpage>&#x02013;740.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16497584</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib30"><citation citation-type="journal">Matsuoka, H., S. Nada, and M. Okada. <year>2004</year>. Mechanism of Csk-mediated down-regulation of Src family tyrosine kinases in epidermal growth factor signaling. <source>J. Biol. Chem.</source> <volume>279</volume>:<fpage>5975</fpage>&#x02013;5983.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14613929</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib31"><citation citation-type="journal">Mayor, S., K.G. Rothberg, and F.R. Maxfield. <year>1994</year>. Sequestration of GPI-anchored proteins in caveolae triggered by cross-linking. <source>Science.</source> <volume>264</volume>:<fpage>1948</fpage>&#x02013;1951.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7516582</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib32"><citation citation-type="journal">Murase, K., T. Fujiwara, Y. Umemura, K. Suzuki, R. Iino, H. Yamashita, M. Saito, H. Murakoshi, K. Ritchie, and A. Kusumi. <year>2004</year>. Ultrafine membrane compartments for molecular diffusion as revealed by single molecule techniques. <source>Biophys. J.</source>